  <section class="section" id="workflows"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Connected workflows</div><h2>Every listing type has its own buying flow.</h2><p class="lead">Sellio supports different customer intentions while preserving a consistent account and communication layer.</p><div class="journeys">
    <div class="journey"><span class="journey-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 4h2l2 12h11l2-8H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="16" cy="19" r="1.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><b>Product purchase</b><div class="steps">
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="5"/><path d="m14 14 5 5M10 7v6M7 10h6"/></svg></i><em>Discover</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h2l2 11h11l2-7H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1"/></svg></i><em>Cart</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M7 15h4"/></svg></i><em>Checkout</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m4 7 8-4 8 4-8 4-8-4Z"/><path d="M4 7v10l8 4 8-4V7M12 11v10"/></svg></i><em>Order</em></span>
    </div></div>
    <div class="journey"><span class="journey-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="15"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/><line x1="7" y1="3" x2="7" y2="7"/><line x1="17" y1="3" x2="17" y2="7"/></svg></span><b>Property or event</b><div class="steps">
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m15 9-2 4-4 2 2-4 4-2Z"/></svg></i><em>Explore</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4M8 15h3"/></svg></i><em>Select dates / tickets</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h14v16H5zM8 2v4M16 2v4M5 9h14"/><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"/></svg></i><em>Book</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h15a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h13"/><path d="M16 11h5v4h-5a2 2 0 0 1 0-4Z"/></svg></i><em>Pay</em></span>
    </div></div>
    <div class="journey"><span class="journey-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17"/><rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="4"/><line x1="8" y1="11" x2="16" y2="11"/><line x1="8" y1="15" x2="16" y2="15"/></svg></span><b>Service or job</b><div class="steps">
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m14.5 14.5 5 5"/></svg></i><em>Search</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 3h14v18H5zM8 7h8M8 11h5"/><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"/></svg></i><em>Review</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 3h11l5 5v13H4zM15 3v5h5M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></i><em>Quote / Apply</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v12H8l-4 4V5Z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg></i><em>Follow up</em></span>
    </div></div>
    <div class="journey"><span class="journey-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 11 L11 3 H20 V12 L12 20 Z"/><circle cx="15.5" cy="7.5" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><b>Vehicle or classified</b><div class="steps">
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg></i><em>Browse</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.8 9a2.4 2.4 0 1 1 3.7 2c-1 .7-1.5 1.2-1.5 2.5M12 17h.01"/></svg></i><em>Ask</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 5h18v13H8l-5 4V5Z"/><path d="M7 9h10M7 13h7"/></svg></i><em>Message</em></span>
      <span><i class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg></i><em>Inquire</em></span>
    </div></div>
  </div></div></section>
